Value VERSION (.+)
Value UPTIME (.+)
Value REBOOT_REASON (.+)
Value BOOT_IMAGE (.+)
Value BOOT_VERSION (.+)
Value BOOT_COMPILED (.+)
Value SYSTEM_IMAGE (.+)
Value SYSTEM_VERSION (.+)
Value SYSTEM_COMPILED (.+)
Value SLOT (\d+)
Value SLOT_UPTIME (.+)
Value PROCESSORS (.+)
Value BOARD_TYPE (.+)
Value DRAM (.+)
Value FLASH (.+)
Value PCB1_VERSION (.+)
Value PCB2_VERSION (.+)
Value BOOTROM_VERSION (.+)
Value CPLD1_VERSION (.+)
Value CPLD2_VERSION (.+)
Value RELEASE_VERSION (.+)
Value PATCH_VERSION (.+)
Value REBOOT_CAUSE (.+)
Value SUBSLOT (.+)

Start
  ^HP Comware Software, Version ${VERSION}
  ^HP \S+ Switch uptime is ${UPTIME}
  ^Last reboot reason : ${REBOOT_REASON}
  ^Boot image: ${BOOT_IMAGE}
  ^Boot image version: ${BOOT_VERSION}
  ^\s+Compiled ${BOOT_COMPILED}
  ^System image: ${SYSTEM_IMAGE}
  ^System image version: ${SYSTEM_VERSION}
  ^\s+Compiled ${SYSTEM_COMPILED}
  ^Slot ${SLOT}:
  ^Uptime is ${SLOT_UPTIME}
  ^FF \S+ Switch with ${PROCESSORS} Processors
  ^BOARD TYPE:\s+${BOARD_TYPE}
  ^DRAM:\s+${DRAM}
  ^FLASH:\s+${FLASH}
  ^PCB 1 Version:\s+${PCB1_VERSION}
  ^PCB 2 Version:\s+${PCB2_VERSION}
  ^Bootrom Version:\s+${BOOTROM_VERSION}
  ^CPLD 1 Version:\s+${CPLD1_VERSION}
  ^CPLD 2 Version:\s+${CPLD2_VERSION}
  ^Release Version:\s+${RELEASE_VERSION}
  ^Patch Version  :\s+${PATCH_VERSION}
  ^Reboot Cause  : \s+${REBOOT_CAUSE}
  ^\[SubSlot ${SUBSLOT}\]